00010 * DSPFALL - one DSPF36 member with a record format per feature.
00020 * Every format starts with a comment saying what it tests. Add new
00030 * cases as new formats at the end. See docs/DSPF-MAPPING.md.
00040 * Convert with MSGF(lib/file) so the message fields are written.
00050
00060 * --- Before the first S: D and H are reported R and skipped ---
00070DEARLYD     5 1 1Y
00080HEARLYH                      315  319
00090Q UNKNOWN RECORD TYPE IN COLUMN 6 (REPORTED R, KEPT AS COMMENT)
00100 * === FKEYY: keys Y, mask 1236AB; right-to-left (col 40, first S) ===
